src/single-sided-lp/CurveConvex2Token.sol:_exitPool:263|C21|High|On CurveInterface.V2 the vault calls remove_liquidity/remove_liquidity_one_coin with use_eth = true, receiver = address(this), so Curve pushes native ETH into the vault's receive() while t_CurrentAccount is still set and _checkReentrancyContext() only guards Curve's own lock — giving an ETH-legged pool a permissionless reentrancy window (no trading-module permission needed) in which the money market prices the position through the escrow branch of convertToAssets.|src/single-sided-lp/CurveConvex2Token.sol
